<title>USA: Datakey gets $464,000 aerospace order.</title>
<headline>Datakey gets $464,000 aerospace order.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datakey Inc, a supplier of portable electronic information systems, said Monday it has received a $464,00 order from an undisclosed aerospace supplier.</p>
<p>The order covers a production run of about 74,000 devices over a six-month period, Datakey said.</p>
<p>The device is used to securely control access to a product used as part of a military communication program, Datakey said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
